  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Communication Protocol of PV Grid-Connected String Inverters",
      "version": "V1.1.53",
      "date": "2023-01-17",
      "url": "https://shop.kpenergy.fi/globalassets/product-sheets/inverters/sungrow/130675/ti_20230117_communication-protocol-of--residential-and-commerical-pv-grid-connected-inverter_v1.1.53_en.pdf",
      "note": "sections 3.1, 3.2 and appendices 1 and 5; document marked Public; linked in issue #185"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Addresses are the protocol addresses of the manual; the wire address is one less (address_base 1).",
    "Read-only data are input registers (FC04); settings are holding registers (FC03/06/16). Input 5000 and holding 5000 are different registers.",
    "32-bit values are sent low word first.",
    "A register the model does not have returns 0xFFFF (16-bit) or 0xFFFFFFFF (32-bit).",
    "Only the registers common to the RT and CX series are listed. Meter, MPPT 13-16, strings 25-32, fault time, country, curve and dispatch registers are not included.",
    "Which MPPT inputs and strings exist, and the setting ranges, depend on the model (appendix 5 of the manual)."
  ],
